From 392390d5e4ff15a698d23685179466357819f2a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MOTOR-47 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:16:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: hide inactive System views again (shortcuts
 subpage)

LOCAL-21 (bt-320e): flyweb://settings/system/shortcuts showed the
shortcuts subpage below the Brave system and memory cards instead of
replacing them. In settings-brave-system-page-index the views carry
.cr-centered-card-container, whose display: block comes from the
element's own tree (cr-shared-style) and so wins over cr-view-manager's
`::slotted([slot=view]) { display: none }`: those views were never
hidden. Upstream Brave puts the class on cr-view-manager instead; here
it stays on the views (settings-system-page already centers its own
section), and a rule in the same tree hides a classed view while it is
neither active nor closing, outside show-all (search) mode. No layout
change for the views that are shown.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2hjxRPyuefYzGRoZRk
---
 .../brave_system_page/brave_system_page_index.html       | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/browser/resources/settings/brave_system_page/brave_system_page_index.html b/browser/resources/settings/brave_system_page/brave_system_page_index.html
index 30f251a893f0bc2da36f7e207d500ec132477c6d..578340799dcd27360d40071f94d1ac0c34622c97 100644
--- a/browser/resources/settings/brave_system_page/brave_system_page_index.html
+++ b/browser/resources/settings/brave_system_page/brave_system_page_index.html
@@ -7,6 +7,15 @@
   cr-view-manager [slot=view]:not(.closing) {
     position: initial;
   }
+
+  /* FlyWeb: .cr-centered-card-container sets display: block from this tree,
+     which wins over cr-view-manager's ::slotted(display: none), so the views
+     that carry it never hid: the shortcuts subpage showed below the system
+     and memory cards. Hide them again when they are not the active view. */
+  cr-view-manager:not([show-all])
+      [slot=view].cr-centered-card-container:not(.active):not(.closing) {
+    display: none;
+  }
 </style>
 
 <!-- No cr-centered-card-container here: settings-system-page already carries
